---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base title="Electric vans and trucks for fleets" description="Plans, calculators and guides for fleet managers switching vans and trucks to electric: total cost, depot charging, grants and driver policies.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Going electric: for fleets</h1>
    <p class="lede">Whether you run five vans or five hundred trucks, the questions are the same: which vehicles can switch now, what will it really cost, and can your depot power them?</p>
    <Cta kind="fleet" />

    <h2>Plan</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/guides/fleet-electrification-plan/"><h3>Step-by-step plan</h3><p>From telematics data to a pilot to full rollout.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/tools/fleet-cost/"><h3>Fleet switch calculator</h3><p>Yearly savings and payback across your fleet.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/guides/depot-charging/"><h3>Depot charging</h3><p>Power, grid connections, charger choice and smart charging.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/guides/grants-and-tax/"><h3>Grants and tax</h3><p>Van and truck grants, van benefit tax, capital allowances.</p></a>
    </div>

    <h2>Choose vehicles</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/vans/"><h3>Electric vans</h3><p>Every model by size, including rebadged twins.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/trucks/"><h3>Electric trucks</h3><p>7.5 to 44 tonnes.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/reliability/"><h3>Reliability data</h3><p>MOT failure rates by model from DVSA records.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/guides/are-electric-trucks-ready/"><h3>Are electric trucks ready?</h3><p>Where they work today and where they don't yet.</p></a>
    </div>

    <h2>Fund</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/tools/lease-or-buy/"><h3>Lease, buy new or buy used?</h3><p>Compare all three over the time you'll keep the vehicles.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/deals/"><h3>Lease deals</h3><p>Ranked by true monthly cost.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/used-electric-vans/"><h3>Used electric vans</h3><p>A cheaper way to add electric vans to a fleet.</p></a>
    </div>

    <div class="notice" style="margin-top:2rem"><strong>Coming soon:</strong> fleet case studies, real-world range by duty cycle, and interviews with fleet managers who've made the switch. Run a fleet and want to share your experience? We'd like to hear from you.</div>
  </div>
</Base>
